            <ArticleTitle>[The use of Spasmomen (otilonium bromide) in pediatrics].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>124-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Spasmomen is an affective medicinal substance for treating functional pathologies of digestive organs in children. The above drug is well tolerated, with no adverse events or complications being associated with its intake. Spasmomen as a drug having spasmolytic effect can be recommended for use in pediatric practice for treating children in all age brackets.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
